00:02:08.557 --> 00:02:11.677
They fear the tracks would cut farmland and threaten how they make a living.

00:02:12.277 --> 00:02:16.997
Guillaume Allory, a third-generation crop farmer, told Global News on Thursday that a line

00:02:16.997 --> 00:02:19.657
